<br>
1.  THE RAIDERS:  The following people attended all or part of the raid (sorry if I missed anyone):  Meakkon, Belnor, Eben, Exidor, Liliun, Yukishori (welcome back to guild), Tyho, Zilben, Enarnage, Procyon, Tooh, Jaqal, Meril, Tressia, Bastvani, Janae, Zankor, Ssolaria.  18 people in all.<br>
<br>
2.  RECAP:  We split into 2-3 groups most of the night.   Tooh's group went into the Archaeologist and Preacher rooms while Meakkon's group went into the Jail Master and Scryer rooms.  At first, the King Room and Archaelogist/Mammoth rooms were camped.  When the King Room cleared up, all the groups went there, where we were generally successful until one unfortunate pull.  The group scattered, at least four people died, and we reformed and rezzed (thank you, Janae, very much) to split loot.<br>
<br>
Two more people joined, but most left after the split (it had been many hours by then).  The new group went to the Archaeologist/Mammoth room, which was now open, and then the scryer room, but we had no luck getting a mammoth hide cloak or another pair of white wolf slippers).  By now very, very tired, we teleported out, but Tressia and Tooh, having failed an intelligence check, had dueled and were unable to teleport out.  Oops.  But all ended well ... I think ...<br>
<br>
3.  LOOT:  We each received some decent platinum.  The following items were distributed or put into the bank, generally after a roll.  I believe the banked items should still be available (please see Tooh or Meakkon):<br>
<br>
Ice Greaves - Tressia (no drop), for Bard equipment for Lyissa<br>
Frost Goblin Totem - Meakkon (no drop), for crafted warrior boots quest<br>
Runed Circlet - Meril (who gave it to Aant to give to Jaqal)<br>
Runed Circlet - Eben<br>
Zaharn's Coronet - Bank (Tooh), AC 5, head, +3str, +25 mana, cleric/druid/shaman, but no Iksar<br>
Crystalline blade - Meril<br>
Crystalline blade - Bank (Meakkon), 1HS, 11-38, who can use?  Let Meakkon know.<br>
Symbol of Loyalty to Vox - Exidor (for Liliun)<br>
Gossamer Veil and shoulders - Eben<br>
Wooly Spider Net - Tyho<br>
White Wolf Slippers - Bastvani (?)<br>
Silvery Two-Handed Axe - Bank (Tooh), rare, 21-48, 8.96 damage per second<br>
Silvery War Axe - Bank (Meakkon), 1HS, 6-22, 5.91 damage per second, who will use this?  Let Meakkon know.<br>
Mammoth Hide Leggings - Eben<br>
Frost Goblin Skin - Eben (Eben also frost giant toes and Flame of Vox)<br>
<br>
And lots of words, runes, pages.  Many miscellaneous items (fine steel, for example) were sold.<br>
<br>
4.  FUTURE RAIDS:  It was chaotic at times, but I enjoyed the camraderie and for some, the loot was decent.  The amount and spirit of the participation impressed me and thank you all for the support.<br>
<br>
Please note that anyone in the guild can lead a raid, formally or informally, and the raid leader has pretty wide discretion (along with the tylenol-inducing stress) on how they wish to run it (loot raids, level-based raids, sign-ups required, etc.).  And I encourage you to do so and you will have my full support. <p>Meakkon the Bold, mighty hobbit warrior and taunter</p><i>Edited by: <A HREF=http://pub50.ezboard.com/umeakkonthebold.showPublicProfile?language=EN>Meakkon the Bold</A> at: 4/17/01 4:11:34 am<br></i></td></tr></table> </td></tr></table> <table border=0 width=95%><tr><td align=left valign="top"> </td><td align=right valign="top"><a href="http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showPrevMessage?topicID=33.topic"> << Prev Topic</a>&nbsp;| <a href="http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showNextMessage?topicID=33.topic"> Next Topic >> </a><br><br><a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.showAddReplyScreenFromWeb?topicID=33.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/addReply.jpg border=0 alt="Add Reply"></a> </td></tr></table><br><table width=95% border=0><td valign="top"> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.emailToFriend?topicID=33.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/image/email.gif border=0 alt="Email This To a Friend"> Email This To a Friend</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.threadControl?topicID=33.topic><img src=http://www.ezboard.com/themes/traditional/deleteThread.gif border=0 alt="Topic Control Image"> Topic Commands (Moderator only)</a><br> <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.subscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=33.topic>Subscribe</a> Click to receive email notification of replies<br>  <a href=http://pub50.ezboard.com/fgoldenlegionfrm2.unsubscribeUnregisteredToTopic?topicID=33.topic>Unsubscribe</a> Click to stop receiving email notification of replies<br> </td><td align="right" valign="top"></td></tr><tr align="right"><td c